WEBVTT


00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:39.829
Life is like hitchhiking without a destination.


00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.631
The steering is up to others and plain luck.


00:00:43.160 --> 00:00:44.878
It never goes the way you want.


00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.355
Fools!


00:04:38.320 --> 00:04:40.709
Possession search!


00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:52.435
I'll take that!
Give it back!


00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:55.032
This too!


00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:08.595
Yeah! Yeah! Confiscated!


00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:11.515
Confiscated!


00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:14.432
Confiscated.


00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:20.468
You got one too!
Confiscated!


00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:24.279
Fuck You!


00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.315
Confiscated!


00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:34.475
Teacher! This is too much!


00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:37.510
What! Furano Keiko!


00:05:41.040 --> 00:05:44.476
And who is this for?


00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:49.196
Don't look at me...


00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.434
Three Months Earlier


00:05:58.920 --> 00:06:00.638
Keiko wants you as a steady.


00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:03.316
You wouldn't refuse, would you?


00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:05.750
There are no good guys in class.


00:06:06.240 --> 00:06:08.310
You just squeeze by.


00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:10.109
ls that a compliment?


00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:13.558
You got a girlfriend?


00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:15.635
Not really...


00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.834
You're mine!


00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:23.156
Mizushima, a ladykiller, huh?


00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.675
Are you being disobedient?


00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.268
Leave him alone!


00:06:30.840 --> 00:06:32.432
You too, Keiko.


00:06:33.000 --> 00:06:36.037
Just because your father is
vice-principal doesn't grant you any favours.


00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:44.713
Daddy!


00:06:45.200 --> 00:06:46.235
Keiko? What's wrong?


00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:48.195
Keiko! Keiko!


00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.555
Keiko!


00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:58.912
Keiko! Keiko! What's wrong?


00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:05.634
Daddy!


00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.880
Mr. Uchiyama is being unreasonable.


00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:10.799
Do something!


00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:14.471
Vice-principal Furano:
teacher of chemistry, physics, biology...


00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:17.359
And one crappy teacher.


00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:27.553
Mr. Uchiyama?


00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:31.151
No belongings unrelated to academics.


00:07:31.560 --> 00:07:33.039
lsn't that the rule?


00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:35.396
Yes! You're absolutely right.


00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:41.997
Look, Keiko.
I'll buy you some chocolate later.


00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:47.678
He scares me.


00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:50.314
He's a stickler and a nit-picker.


00:07:51.080 --> 00:07:52.559
I can hear you.


00:07:56.920 --> 00:07:58.876
The bell has rung.
Break time.


00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:00.793
Gotta go.


00:08:02.280 --> 00:08:03.474
Good luck, Keiko.


00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:06.949
Daddy...


00:08:08.360 --> 00:08:10.669
Items unrelated to study...


00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:14.039
find new life in the trash!


00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:16.675
End of story!


00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:51.231
Victory will be ours!


00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:56.915
What did you make of
today's chocolate confiscation?


00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:00.109
Give chocolate back!
Give chocolate back!


00:09:00.320 --> 00:09:02.231
What did you think, Captain Kiriko?


00:09:03.440 --> 00:09:04.509
I wanna return.


00:09:05.560 --> 00:09:06.754
Where to?


00:09:07.800 --> 00:09:08.869
To the soil...


00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:12.233
You guys wanna cut?


00:09:12.800 --> 00:09:13.994
We do!


00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:17.349
It's unhealthy to cut so quickly.


00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:19.358
Let's start with a warm-up.


00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:21.395
Yes!


00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:22.755
Extend hands...


00:09:24.360 --> 00:09:26.430
Wrist exercise start,


00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:27.830
And a...


00:09:28.040 --> 00:09:35.037
One, two, three, four, five, six, seven... ...


00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:37.556
I'm tired. Enough already.


00:09:38.280 --> 00:09:39.952
You're totally self-centered...


00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:42.953
We call out and unify our bond.


00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:47.235
With all our vigour!


00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.635
Cut the wrists!


00:09:48.800 --> 00:09:50.950
Sodium cut!
Wrist cut!


00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:54.835
Great work!!


00:09:55.600 --> 00:09:57.033
Just a few more days till the rally.


00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.360
Remember our slogan:


00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:01.191
''Not too deep! Avoid the artery!''


00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:03.755
Here we go!


00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.355
Grip the cutter knife.
Slice the wrist!


00:10:06.920 --> 00:10:09.150
Grip the cutter knife.
Slice the wrist!


00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:10.315
Cut lightly!


00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:11.915
Cut deeply!


00:10:12.280 --> 00:10:13.235
Cut forcefully!


00:10:13.640 --> 00:10:14.595
Cut vigourously!


00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:16.875
Self-expression!


00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:18.789
Pay more attention to me!


00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.234
Mizushima Jyugon!


00:10:29.320 --> 00:10:30.992
You walk fast.


00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:35.950
Who are you?


00:10:37.480 --> 00:10:38.799
Your classmate.


00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:40.789
Arukado Monami.


00:10:41.840 --> 00:10:43.319
The new transfer student.


00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:50.714
My name is Arukado Monami.


00:10:51.040 --> 00:10:52.359
Nice to meet you.


00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:55.840
She came in at the end of the year.


00:10:56.720 --> 00:10:57.675
She's beautiful.


00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:01.155
Normally that would stand out...


00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.233
but it doesn't


00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.152
Nobody cares if she's around.


00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:07.833
ln fact, she's usually not around.


00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:11.952
Because, according to her...


00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:15.790
The weather's too nice
and the sun's too bright!


00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:22.350
Was that cape a part of
your previous school's uniform?


00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:26.838
No. It's a keepsake from my mother.


00:11:31.560 --> 00:11:32.515
Got a moment?


00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:40.232
It's chocolate.


00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:42.275
Please accept it.


00:11:43.560 --> 00:11:44.515
It wasn't confiscated.


00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.116
The possession search?


00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:51.713
Maybe it's because I don't standout and
the chocolate was so tiny.


00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:53.515
Probably so.


00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:58.716
I've no courage and could only
prepare a chocolate this small...


00:11:59.080 --> 00:12:00.718
but in the end it all worked out.


00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:07.274
I thought it was God
saying I should give it to you.


00:12:10.280 --> 00:12:12.396
Will you accept it?


00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:36.435
Tasty!


00:12:39.640 --> 00:12:41.358
This taste...


00:12:42.920 --> 00:12:48.870
is like licking a finger cut
during inept kitchen work


00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:51.155
It's blood!


00:13:05.560 --> 00:13:08.199
What is this?!?


00:13:09.120 --> 00:13:10.075
What!


00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:17.755
GANGURO CLUB
Grafitti-Morons! You're Japanese


00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.430
Where'd ya get that tan?


00:14:20.960 --> 00:14:23.474
ln Shibuya next to Tsutaya.


00:14:23.680 --> 00:14:25.989
Want some gum?
It's green gum.


00:14:26.600 --> 00:14:28.192
Fuck!


00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:32.315
Only black gum. Got it?


00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:33.355
Sorry.


00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:37.872
Anyone want coffee?
I'm going for some latte.


00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:39.873
Fuck!


00:14:40.200 --> 00:14:42.270
Only black coffee.


00:14:42.760 --> 00:14:46.753
You think you can put
white in anything like Michael!


00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:50.717
What's with that guy?


00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.594
You're black! Black!


00:14:55.120 --> 00:15:00.035
I know we're the ganguro club and all,
but we're not ganguro! This is too much!


00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:06.355
Black Power!


00:15:06.720 --> 00:15:08.631
We're ganguro gals, right?


00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:11.633
We swore allegiance!


00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:14.431
You forget Obama's words?


00:15:15.240 --> 00:15:16.639
Change, change, change!


00:15:16.840 --> 00:15:18.159
Change, change, change!


00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:33.476
We're the ganguro. Like a sushi roll.
Like a lump of coal. We got rhythm. We got soul!


00:15:40.360 --> 00:15:41.793
Joyner!


00:15:42.800 --> 00:15:44.711
Where's she going?


00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:51.149
Good morning. You've
been absent for three days.


00:15:51.680 --> 00:15:52.795
Are you okay?


00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:59.435
You still look out of it.


00:16:11.040 --> 00:16:12.189
Something on your mind?


00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:17.753
Where to begin?


00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:21.630
Good. No sign of rejection.


00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:23.793
Seems to suit your physiology.


00:16:25.320 --> 00:16:27.629
What are you talking about?


00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.594
The chocolate.


00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:35.353
That chocolate. That red cream?
What was that? Give me the recipe!


00:16:36.320 --> 00:16:37.275
That?


00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:38.995
That...


00:16:39.440 --> 00:16:41.158
That was my blood.


00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.553
How embarrassing!


00:16:44.840 --> 00:16:46.478
It's not about embarrassment!


00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:49.631
Why'd you do such a creepy thing?


00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:51.795
Because...


00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:54.835
I've fallen in love with you.


00:16:55.760 --> 00:16:59.594
I want us to live together.


00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:02.195
I don't understand.


00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.357
I've been feeling weird since I ate it.


00:17:11.320 --> 00:17:12.753
Can we talk later?


00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:17.112
It's sunny.
I don't want to be outside.


00:17:24.680 --> 00:17:27.956
What were you talking
about with that transfer girl?


00:17:30.320 --> 00:17:31.275
Keiko!


00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.951
That chocolate...


00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:35.515
Chocolate?


00:17:35.800 --> 00:17:39.270
That girl gave you chocolate?


00:17:39.680 --> 00:17:41.716
Even Keiko couldn't give you any!


00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:45.275
Did you eat it?


00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:49.875
Did you?


00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:52.475
Well?


00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:55.675
I want...


00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:58.115
blood!


00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:02.635
What the hell?


00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:09.235
Jyugon, you OK?


00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.675
Nothing.


00:18:21.560 --> 00:18:25.439
This cutter cuts well.


00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:29.157
The perfect blade for our anniversary


00:18:32.640 --> 00:18:37.270
Captain, we have something for you.


00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.630
Another cutter?
I've got one already.


00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:42.068
Not at all.


00:18:44.400 --> 00:18:46.356
-Spinach!
-It's pesticide-free.


00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:48.473
You're anaemic.


00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:52.709
Thank you! Thank you!


00:18:55.120 --> 00:19:00.069
We want you back in high form, captain.


00:19:01.760 --> 00:19:05.469
We want to see Kiriko captain cut.


00:19:05.640 --> 00:19:10.430
Cut, cut, cut, wrist cut!


00:19:12.000 --> 00:19:13.592
Getting there!


00:19:14.680 --> 00:19:20.357
Vertical, horizontal, irregular cuts!


00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.751
Violin. Violin.


00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:27.318
I will be a Christ in the wrist cut world.


00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:32.754
Gotta cut!


00:19:38.520 --> 00:19:41.751
I feel dizzy.
Got a headache.


00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:42.955
Oh my!


00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:46.034
Want some medicine?


00:19:47.560 --> 00:19:50.518
Or do you want to get down in bed?


00:19:51.080 --> 00:19:54.470
This is Midori, the
over-sexed school nurse.


00:19:55.720 --> 00:19:57.790
The male students all
have a thing for her.


00:19:58.920 --> 00:19:59.875
This way.


00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:11.671
Are you ready to drink blood?


00:20:14.000 --> 00:20:15.069
You!


00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:17.994
You're doing fine.


00:20:18.840 --> 00:20:19.795
What is!?


00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:23.716
Wanting blood is...?


00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:24.995
A vampire.


00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:28.515
Me too.


00:20:29.480 --> 00:20:30.708
I'm a...


00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:32.315
a vampire.


00:20:33.200 --> 00:20:36.237
You ate chocolate with my blood in it.


00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:37.959
Now you're half a vampire.


00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:42.920
Drink more and you
can be a full vampire.


00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:44.155
I don't want to be one!


00:20:54.560 --> 00:20:55.629
Here you go.


00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:01.675
Looks delicious.


00:21:11.560 --> 00:21:14.313
Jyugon! What's going on?


00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:17.037
Well...


00:21:20.640 --> 00:21:25.031
New student! What are you
trying to pull on my boyfriend?


00:21:26.240 --> 00:21:27.195
Answer me?


00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:30.431
ls this really your type?


00:21:31.000 --> 00:21:32.069
She looks nasty?


00:21:32.920 --> 00:21:34.638
Don't say that in front of her.


00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:36.555
What!


00:21:48.800 --> 00:21:51.598
We were interrupted.
Let's pick it up later, okay?


00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:58.075
Later!?


00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:12.389
I think he's the new janitor.


00:22:13.560 --> 00:22:18.156
I heard the previous one
disappeared a month ago.


00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:20.029
That damn vice-principal
is just a persona.


00:23:20.560 --> 00:23:27.398
I, Furano Kenji, am the
scientist of the century.


00:23:27.720 --> 00:23:31.554
I am successor to the
famous Dr. Frankenstein.


00:23:31.720 --> 00:23:39.308
Someday I'll uncover
the mystery of human life!


00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:48.993
You should be thankful you can be
material for my genius experiment.


00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:51.235
Holy mother!


00:23:51.640 --> 00:23:54.074
He's alive, Midori!


00:23:54.600 --> 00:23:56.591
I'm trying to revive the dead.


00:23:56.760 --> 00:23:58.671
You should have killed him first!


00:23:59.400 --> 00:24:00.355
I'll get to it.


00:24:29.320 --> 00:24:30.435
Can we do it?


00:25:06.200 --> 00:25:07.519
Can we do it?


00:25:13.160 --> 00:25:14.229
Can we do it?


00:25:44.520 --> 00:25:45.669
Yes we can!


00:25:53.720 --> 00:25:55.517
So...?


00:25:56.040 --> 00:25:57.553
Excellent skill.


00:25:58.160 --> 00:26:01.516
This is not tea ceremony
or flower arrangement.


00:26:02.480 --> 00:26:03.674
It's dead!


00:26:04.600 --> 00:26:05.999
This thing can't come back to life.


00:26:06.960 --> 00:26:09.235
This sucks!


00:26:31.880 --> 00:26:35.953
I hear Mr. Uchiyama has been
getting into stalking female students.


00:26:53.840 --> 00:27:00.916
I hear that Monami has been
doing compensated dating.


00:27:01.960 --> 00:27:03.518
What!?


00:27:09.360 --> 00:27:14.559
Leaking insulting rumours
It's all a part of Keiko's strategy.


00:27:16.840 --> 00:27:17.795
And you don't?


00:27:18.400 --> 00:27:19.879
-No way!
-You should.


00:27:26.600 --> 00:27:28.716
It didn't last long.


00:27:30.440 --> 00:27:33.318
Soon after, Uchiyama went missing.


00:27:34.960 --> 00:27:36.234
Class is starting.


00:27:37.640 --> 00:27:38.959
Doesn't really matter to me, though.


00:27:43.960 --> 00:27:45.234
Mr. Uchiyama?


00:27:47.360 --> 00:27:48.315
How did you know?


00:27:49.040 --> 00:27:52.749
You think I drank his blood and
killed him because he found out my secret?


00:27:55.720 --> 00:27:57.039
I didn't say that.


00:27:58.080 --> 00:27:59.035
It's true.


00:27:59.400 --> 00:28:00.355
You're serious?


00:28:12.560 --> 00:28:13.515
You!


00:28:14.480 --> 00:28:17.517
It's dangerous for a
girl to walk around this late.


00:28:19.160 --> 00:28:21.151
Should we go somewhere?


00:28:22.000 --> 00:28:22.955
You hungry?


00:28:24.600 --> 00:28:25.555
I am.


00:28:25.920 --> 00:28:27.558
What do you want to eat?


00:28:28.760 --> 00:28:29.988
Your blood.


00:28:30.560 --> 00:28:31.515
What?


00:30:14.800 --> 00:30:17.234
See! No good, right?


00:30:17.360 --> 00:30:18.588
It's really scary!


00:30:21.160 --> 00:30:24.596
You were drunk.
That makes me drunk too.


00:30:40.640 --> 00:30:41.834
Good evening,teacher.


00:30:43.080 --> 00:30:47.198
Staying out late is bad.
But stalking is even worse.


00:31:02.960 --> 00:31:03.915
There!


00:31:04.080 --> 00:31:06.913
Igor is burning Uchiyama's body.


00:31:20.600 --> 00:31:21.555
Igor?


00:31:22.720 --> 00:31:24.358
The new janitor?


00:31:25.960 --> 00:31:26.915
You know him?


00:31:28.520 --> 00:31:30.909
Know him...?


00:31:31.480 --> 00:31:32.549
He's like a servant.


00:31:33.560 --> 00:31:35.391
Or maybe a slave!


00:31:36.440 --> 00:31:37.395
A slave!


00:31:38.960 --> 00:31:44.478
Did you kill the previous
janitor and have Igor burn him as well.


00:31:45.080 --> 00:31:47.196
-That's right!
-That's NOT right!


00:31:47.680 --> 00:31:50.831
It's convenient to have a servant.


00:31:51.560 --> 00:31:53.790
He mainly disposes of dead bodies.


00:31:54.240 --> 00:31:57.277
A janitor was the perfect
position for him to sneak into school.


00:32:00.960 --> 00:32:02.791
By the way...


00:32:04.200 --> 00:32:07.715
are we going to live together?


00:32:10.720 --> 00:32:13.154
I feel I'm lost in time.


00:32:25.080 --> 00:32:27.036
They call me Afro Rika.


00:32:28.200 --> 00:32:30.270
But my real name is Tanaka Hanako.


00:32:34.760 --> 00:32:37.320
I wear special-effect makeup to school.


00:32:41.560 --> 00:32:43.755
Why was I born Japanese?


00:32:46.760 --> 00:32:49.672
I wish I'd been born
into the coolest race.


00:32:53.280 --> 00:32:54.918
I'm going for the world.


00:32:56.600 --> 00:33:00.991
I'll be the world's
fastest 100 meter ganguro girl!


00:33:04.520 --> 00:33:05.919
The world awaits.


00:33:07.000 --> 00:33:09.594
I'm flying from Japan
and right into the world.


00:33:53.160 --> 00:33:54.115
What the?


00:34:55.320 --> 00:34:57.834
What do you mean, live together?


00:34:59.160 --> 00:35:03.153
I mean, you drink my blood and
become a vampire like me.


00:35:03.680 --> 00:35:05.830
Then you can remain
how you are for good.


00:35:06.560 --> 00:35:07.515
Not bad?


00:35:08.040 --> 00:35:09.268
Sounds bad enough.


00:35:11.040 --> 00:35:16.956
A girl confesses her love with all her
heart and even gives Valentine chocolate.


00:35:19.040 --> 00:35:20.598
You should respond accordingly.


00:35:22.080 --> 00:35:26.232
You put blood in the
chocolate. Not love.


00:35:32.240 --> 00:35:35.118
This is the blood you were
talking about.


00:35:40.680 --> 00:35:42.113
Midori, tone it down.


00:35:43.440 --> 00:35:44.509
Excuse me.


00:36:01.880 --> 00:36:05.156
I told you to get out of that habit.


00:36:27.600 --> 00:36:28.555
This?


00:36:30.920 --> 00:36:31.989
You want this?


00:36:34.120 --> 00:36:35.075
This?


00:36:45.880 --> 00:36:47.996
This is...


00:36:48.760 --> 00:36:50.079
wonderful!


00:36:51.240 --> 00:36:54.789
The key to my research!


00:37:01.160 --> 00:37:02.434
Can I have your attention?


00:37:03.920 --> 00:37:04.875
'Zhou Yuan'


00:37:05.520 --> 00:37:07.556
Say it aloud: 'Zhou Yuan'


00:37:11.040 --> 00:37:12.871
Ju-on in Japanese.


00:37:13.240 --> 00:37:15.231
There's a movie of this name.


00:37:15.720 --> 00:37:17.790
Anybody seen it?


00:37:19.240 --> 00:37:21.071
Great! You too. You too.


00:37:21.160 --> 00:37:22.513
Great director too!


00:37:23.320 --> 00:37:28.474
It went to part 2 before being remade
in the US as 'The Grudge'.


00:37:30.040 --> 00:37:33.191
''The Grudge.'
It's in English.


00:37:40.240 --> 00:37:43.630
Let's get back to Kanji
since this is Chinese class.


00:37:47.440 --> 00:37:49.032
They are both skipping class?


00:37:50.320 --> 00:37:51.912
Suspicious, no?


00:38:01.320 --> 00:38:02.309
I won't let that happen!


00:38:06.160 --> 00:38:08.833
Any problems with my lecture?


00:38:10.880 --> 00:38:12.598
If you interrupt, you will be cursed.


00:39:01.360 --> 00:39:02.315
Dad!


00:39:32.880 --> 00:39:36.350
Where did you get this?


00:39:36.920 --> 00:39:38.478
It was on the floor
of the nurse's room.


00:39:39.360 --> 00:39:42.318
It's from Arukado Monami.


00:39:44.920 --> 00:39:47.309
Arukado Monami?


00:39:48.320 --> 00:39:49.275
Monami?


00:39:57.040 --> 00:39:59.998
A transfer student.
Doesn't stand out.


00:40:00.320 --> 00:40:02.151
Has a high presence rate in
the nurse's room.


00:40:05.040 --> 00:40:06.268
Should we get her too?


00:40:08.360 --> 00:40:12.069
You'd like that?


00:40:17.760 --> 00:40:21.514
Arukado Monami, what the hell is she?


00:40:25.160 --> 00:40:26.513
Would love to cut her open.


00:41:34.240 --> 00:41:35.719
What do you say?


00:41:38.400 --> 00:41:39.355
No way!


00:41:40.120 --> 00:41:41.473
Who would want to be a vampire?


00:41:42.000 --> 00:41:42.955
Okay...


00:41:43.200 --> 00:41:45.998
You know my secret.
You'll have to die.


00:41:47.560 --> 00:41:48.515
ln that case...


00:41:48.920 --> 00:41:50.114
I'd love to be a vampire.


00:41:50.880 --> 00:41:51.835
Great!


00:41:58.080 --> 00:42:00.719
Before someone interrupts us again.


00:43:06.240 --> 00:43:07.195
What is this?


00:43:08.200 --> 00:43:09.155
Where is this?


00:43:11.680 --> 00:43:12.635
Who is that?


00:43:12.920 --> 00:43:14.797
Your mother?


00:43:15.640 --> 00:43:20.873
She came to Japan to
escape from the vampire hunter.


00:43:28.600 --> 00:43:29.635
ls that you?


00:43:31.800 --> 00:43:32.755
Stay right here.


00:43:33.240 --> 00:43:37.279
But the vampire hunter chased her down.


00:43:39.880 --> 00:43:42.792
Is this St. Francis Xavier?


00:43:46.120 --> 00:43:49.795
I will protect my happiness!


00:43:50.840 --> 00:43:55.914
Devil descendant!
You have nowhere to escape.


00:43:56.400 --> 00:43:57.753
"Sumo from hell"


00:46:14.800 --> 00:46:15.755
lmbecile!


00:47:12.560 --> 00:47:13.515
Since then...


00:47:14.520 --> 00:47:17.353
I've been living on my own.


00:47:31.800 --> 00:47:33.028
How old are you?


00:47:33.680 --> 00:47:35.238
I stopped counting.


00:47:37.800 --> 00:47:40.553
How does it feel?


00:47:45.880 --> 00:47:46.835
What is this?


00:47:49.360 --> 00:47:51.351
It's OK.They are replaced.


00:47:52.720 --> 00:47:53.675
Show me.


00:47:55.400 --> 00:47:56.515
A little more...


00:47:57.440 --> 00:47:58.395
Yes. please!


00:48:02.040 --> 00:48:04.349
Jyugon! Get away from her!


00:48:05.680 --> 00:48:07.079
She's a monster!


00:48:07.240 --> 00:48:08.309
I saw her blood.


00:48:08.760 --> 00:48:11.672
It was alive and moving.
Not human blood!


00:48:13.880 --> 00:48:15.108
I'm a vampire.


00:48:16.320 --> 00:48:17.275
A vampire?


00:48:17.800 --> 00:48:19.711
You'll get killed, Jyugon!


00:48:20.160 --> 00:48:22.628
I wouldn't kill someone I like.


00:48:23.200 --> 00:48:25.395
Plus, he's a vampire now.


00:48:27.720 --> 00:48:28.675
See!


00:48:30.280 --> 00:48:31.235
Something like that...


00:48:31.440 --> 00:48:33.749
This is impossible!


00:48:36.320 --> 00:48:38.231
You bitch! It's all your fault!


00:48:52.040 --> 00:48:52.995
You never quit.


00:49:03.240 --> 00:49:04.195
Keiko!


00:49:17.920 --> 00:49:21.629
She knew my secret. It saved time.


00:49:22.040 --> 00:49:23.155
It's not about saving time!


00:49:24.280 --> 00:49:27.272
She said something about
someone having my blood.


00:49:28.200 --> 00:49:29.553
I should've asked more about that.


00:49:30.000 --> 00:49:31.115
That's not the point!


00:49:32.640 --> 00:49:35.108
But, that was the point.


00:51:17.920 --> 00:51:19.239
Stupendous!


00:51:20.640 --> 00:51:22.358
Too stupendous!


00:51:25.600 --> 00:51:26.555
This is it!


00:51:27.400 --> 00:51:30.676
My research is nearly complete!


00:51:34.480 --> 00:51:36.869
Doctor, emergency! It's Keiko!


00:51:39.040 --> 00:51:39.995
What happened to Keiko?


00:51:41.680 --> 00:51:42.795
There are students up there.


00:51:47.520 --> 00:51:48.669
They're coming.


00:51:49.600 --> 00:51:50.874
What a pain.


00:52:11.480 --> 00:52:12.595
What happened?


00:52:13.200 --> 00:52:14.872
Convenient, no?


00:52:31.200 --> 00:52:32.269
I grieve your loss.


00:52:55.040 --> 00:52:55.995
Doctor?


00:52:58.480 --> 00:53:01.119
This is great!


00:53:02.240 --> 00:53:05.232
I can chop up her body!


00:53:06.840 --> 00:53:11.755
Every father with a
daughter dreams of this.


00:53:12.440 --> 00:53:13.714
What bliss!


00:53:15.480 --> 00:53:16.435
My daughter!


00:53:17.520 --> 00:53:19.715
My lovely daughter!


00:53:20.480 --> 00:53:24.029
Dicing one's daughter is true happiness!


00:53:24.280 --> 00:53:26.840
Doctor, that's kind of dodgy.


00:53:30.680 --> 00:53:31.635
Shut up!


00:53:32.440 --> 00:53:34.874
Mere mortals mustn't
interfere with a genius at work!


00:53:35.360 --> 00:53:36.315
Sorry.


00:53:39.800 --> 00:53:42.439
Need more parts. Get me more parts!


00:54:00.440 --> 00:54:05.195
Then there was a rash of serial murders.


00:54:06.320 --> 00:54:08.629
Tokyo Public High
School boiled over with fear.


00:54:09.640 --> 00:54:14.270
Kiriko, winner of the
nation-wide wrist cut rally:


00:54:15.040 --> 00:54:18.828
Her tougher than cutter
blade wrists were lopped off.


00:54:22.000 --> 00:54:25.151
Afro Rika, blacked up
ganguro club captain:


00:54:25.600 --> 00:54:29.593
Her legs as strong as a
black athlete were torn off.


00:54:32.240 --> 00:54:35.391
Chinese teacher Kohan:


00:54:35.880 --> 00:54:40.317
His lungs tough enough to
handle grimy auto emissions.


00:54:41.440 --> 00:54:44.352
So strong were they he could
smoke ten cigarettes at a time.


00:54:45.320 --> 00:54:46.912
Those mighty lungs were hacked out.


00:54:47.920 --> 00:54:52.198
The criminal was Midori,
who cast off her sexy nurse guise..


00:54:52.960 --> 00:54:56.236
to reveal a psycho killer.


00:55:17.200 --> 00:55:23.514
Finally, the psycho killer was brought down by
the Save the Tokyo High School Association...


00:55:23.840 --> 00:55:26.308
abduction victims and the student body.


00:55:43.480 --> 00:55:45.675
You're coming with us.


00:55:46.840 --> 00:55:49.035
Abducted again?


00:56:11.240 --> 00:56:15.756
"Monami: come to the gym tonight!"


00:56:15.960 --> 00:56:18.838
"From Comeback Keiko".


00:56:48.160 --> 00:56:49.115
Monami!


00:56:49.480 --> 00:56:50.515
You're late.


00:56:52.080 --> 00:56:53.433
I thought you wouldn't come.


00:56:54.400 --> 00:56:57.437
Actually, I didn't feel like coming.


00:56:57.720 --> 00:56:58.675
Hey!


00:56:59.160 --> 00:57:01.879
Now you know who's best as
Jyugon's girlfriend.


00:57:03.240 --> 00:57:05.231
lsn't that right?


00:57:06.880 --> 00:57:07.835
lf you say so.


00:57:09.920 --> 00:57:11.797
Still looking to compete?


00:57:12.720 --> 00:57:16.110
Transfer students
should cower in the corner.


00:57:16.960 --> 00:57:18.871
They should be quiet!


00:57:20.160 --> 00:57:21.832
I've been trying...


00:57:22.600 --> 00:57:23.828
Right, Jyugon?


00:57:24.520 --> 00:57:26.351
Don't ask me.


00:57:27.000 --> 00:57:29.434
You don't understand no
matter how much I talk.


00:57:41.000 --> 00:57:44.072
Don't underestimate the
wrists of the wrist cut club.


00:57:48.480 --> 00:57:50.198
Or ganguro legs!


00:58:25.520 --> 00:58:26.475
Keiko!


00:58:47.800 --> 00:58:48.755
Monami!


00:58:54.400 --> 00:58:56.675
Don't think I am who I used to be.


00:59:01.640 --> 00:59:02.595
Not bad.


00:59:08.200 --> 00:59:09.349
Now we're talking.


00:59:11.560 --> 00:59:16.759
And this is how the battle over love
between Vampire Girl and Frankenstein Girl began.


00:59:17.600 --> 00:59:19.830
By the way, has anyone
considered my feelings?


00:59:43.880 --> 00:59:47.077
No way a dull edge like that is
going to penetrate the wrists.


01:00:36.360 --> 01:00:39.079
Igor! Please help Jyugon!


01:00:44.400 --> 01:00:45.719
You won't escape me!


01:01:21.200 --> 01:01:22.633
I said wait!


01:01:28.880 --> 01:01:30.074
We have to help Monami!


01:01:31.880 --> 01:01:33.472
Hold on! Hold on!


01:01:33.840 --> 01:01:36.115
Here comes the judge!
Here comes the judge!


01:01:36.880 --> 01:01:39.075
Kick out the jams! Bang a drum!


01:01:39.400 --> 01:01:42.597
You ain't seen nothing yet!


01:01:44.320 --> 01:01:47.357
Mr. Furano? What's with that get up?


01:01:48.920 --> 01:01:50.797
I will vivisect Monami.


01:01:51.200 --> 01:01:57.435
She is the linchpin of my research.


01:02:08.680 --> 01:02:09.635
Nurse Midori?


01:02:25.880 --> 01:02:28.075
What can a high school student like me...


01:02:28.680 --> 01:02:31.433
do in a crazy battle between crazy monsters?


01:06:33.560 --> 01:06:35.710
You're nothing without your cape.


01:07:23.720 --> 01:07:25.233
I'll rip it to shreds!


01:08:18.240 --> 01:08:19.195
The Finishing blow.


01:08:25.920 --> 01:08:29.196
Do you like Chinese auto emission? Delicious?


01:08:38.360 --> 01:08:42.478
Fall! Just fall!
Fall all the way to hell!


01:08:54.880 --> 01:08:58.316
Wake up! No time to sleep!


01:09:03.480 --> 01:09:04.549
Jyugon.


01:09:05.240 --> 01:09:07.629
Hang in there! Don't give up!


01:09:08.840 --> 01:09:11.149
You're the Vampire Girl.


01:09:12.320 --> 01:09:13.275
What do you need?


01:09:14.320 --> 01:09:15.275
Blood?


01:09:15.720 --> 01:09:16.675
You need Blood?


01:09:18.200 --> 01:09:19.997
Open your mouth!


01:09:44.400 --> 01:09:47.756
You two! No making out!


01:09:49.160 --> 01:09:50.115
Get back up there!


01:09:51.480 --> 01:09:52.435
Just do it!


01:09:55.160 --> 01:09:59.711
Thank you, Jyugon. I love you.


01:10:30.200 --> 01:10:33.954
Bitch...drop dead!


01:10:55.400 --> 01:10:58.870
Stupid girl. You've cut me for the last time.


01:11:51.040 --> 01:11:52.109
Way to go.


01:11:53.520 --> 01:11:55.112
You're the best.


01:11:57.680 --> 01:11:58.635
Me too...


01:11:59.840 --> 01:12:00.795
I love you.


01:12:13.960 --> 01:12:14.915
I was waiting.


01:12:16.680 --> 01:12:17.999
Do that thing with your cape.


01:12:19.200 --> 01:12:20.474
Won't work.


01:12:21.080 --> 01:12:22.035
Why not?


01:12:28.840 --> 01:12:30.398
Are we both going to die?


01:12:32.160 --> 01:12:33.115
Don't be silly.


01:12:34.000 --> 01:12:37.072
Although two are impossible,
it can still manage one.


01:12:39.840 --> 01:12:42.673
I will protect my happiness.


01:12:45.320 --> 01:12:46.878
Monami!


01:12:57.920 --> 01:13:00.992
You think a mere janitor
can defeat the vice-principle?


01:13:26.040 --> 01:13:28.315
Hey! What are you doing?


01:13:29.240 --> 01:13:30.753
Come on down!


01:13:31.800 --> 01:13:33.199
Easy to say,...


01:13:34.800 --> 01:13:37.030
but I've got a serious lack of blood.


01:13:50.960 --> 01:13:52.473
I felt time stop.


01:14:15.920 --> 01:14:17.035
Monami was falling.


01:14:17.240 --> 01:14:19.037
Monami was dying. No way!


01:14:19.800 --> 01:14:22.872
You can't change my body
like this and leave me.


01:14:23.680 --> 01:14:27.195
I won't live by myself...


01:14:28.160 --> 01:14:30.993
in this body for hundreds of years.


01:14:32.800 --> 01:14:33.755
Since then...


01:14:35.000 --> 01:14:37.719
I've been living on my own.


01:14:41.040 --> 01:14:45.033
You've been living like this for years.


01:14:47.200 --> 01:14:49.509
I didn't understand when
you gave me the chocolate.


01:14:50.600 --> 01:14:51.920
I just didn't get it.


01:14:51.920 --> 01:14:54.354
I've fallen in love with you!


01:14:55.160 --> 01:14:58.948
I want us to live together.


01:14:59.520 --> 01:15:05.152
A girl confesses her love with all her
heart and even gives Valentine chocolate.


01:15:06.480 --> 01:15:08.198
You should respond accordingly.


01:15:11.880 --> 01:15:13.552
I'm beginning to see...


01:15:14.800 --> 01:15:17.268
how lonely and desperate it is...


01:15:18.280 --> 01:15:19.633
to live alone for hundreds of years.


01:15:21.120 --> 01:15:23.395
You were grasping at straws.


01:16:09.720 --> 01:16:10.675
Mr. Igor.


01:16:51.800 --> 01:16:52.755
Let's go.


01:16:53.840 --> 01:16:55.193
To where?


01:16:55.840 --> 01:16:57.478
Anywhere is good, isn't it?


01:16:58.760 --> 01:16:59.715
I guess...


01:17:09.440 --> 01:17:10.395
Well...


01:17:12.080 --> 01:17:13.035
Anyway....


01:17:14.360 --> 01:17:16.271
I'm not going to leave you alone anymore.


01:17:18.400 --> 01:17:19.753
I have Monami...


01:17:21.240 --> 01:17:22.309
and Monami has me.


01:17:24.760 --> 01:17:26.079
We'll be together forever.


01:17:28.000 --> 01:17:29.399
Igor is dead.


01:17:30.240 --> 01:17:33.073
When I make someone a vampire
after a hundred years,


01:17:33.280 --> 01:17:35.669
they suddenly get old and decay.


01:17:36.760 --> 01:17:38.239
Maybe you will too.


01:17:39.240 --> 01:17:42.198
Anyway, stay with me
until that day, Jyugon.


01:17:45.760 --> 01:17:46.829
You mean,


01:17:47.400 --> 01:17:49.595
I'm just filling Igor's shoes?


01:17:50.760 --> 01:17:51.715
Am I a slave?


01:17:56.000 --> 01:17:56.955
You know...


01:17:58.280 --> 01:17:59.235
What?


01:18:15.680 --> 01:18:21.550
I have evolved!


01:18:25.520 --> 01:18:26.475
What is it?


01:18:29.360 --> 01:18:30.509
How many before me?


01:18:33.000 --> 01:18:34.513
I don't count
that sort of thing!

